    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "Hehe, how about Nanami tell you a story, Commandant? It'll be our intermission!",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "In a future far, far away—about as far... as the time between T-Rex and today!",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "Humanity suddenly discovers a black dwarf star hurtling toward our solar system! In less than a century, it would smash into the sun and destroy the entire solar system!",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "During that same era, humans discover something incredible: seven thousand light-years away, in a distant galaxy, there exists an advanced alien civilization capable of harnessing the power of stars.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "So humans thought, \"Maybe we could ask this super-advanced civilization to help save Earth?\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "How did they do it?",
            17
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "Electromagnetic communication was too slow, so the clever scientists invented a new technology! It could convert human telepathy into signals and transmit information faster than light!",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "But according to calculations, to create a signal powerful enough to cross seven thousand light-years, billions—tens of billions of people would need to broadcast the same emotional signal simultaneously!",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "At first, the scientists thought inducing fear would be the most efficient approach. I mean, even babies cry right after birth—it's one of humanity's most instinctive responses.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "But then, a wise scientist sent a letter to the President of Earth where he presented a completely different perspective—",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "What did he say?",
            22
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "He said that fear wasn't the ultimate choice, that humanity possessed an emotion far more powerful than fear! To prove his point, he quoted a poem as his answer—",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "\"We must love one another, or die.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "So...",
            25
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 25,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "It's love! Love can overcome fear, and even transcend gravity and time itself!",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "What an enlightening story.",
            28,
            "It feels quite abstract.",
            28
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nanami",
            "It's from a human author that Nanami really likes. I'll make sure to tell you more stories whenever I can.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "It's a deal, then.",
            31
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
